<title>UK: Plasmon up after positive press comment.</title>
<headline>Plasmon up after positive press comment.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in CD and computer tape back-up maker Plasmon Plc jumped on Monday after positive press comment on the stock, dealers said.</p>
<p>Plasmon shares were up 14-1/2p to 211 by 0815 GMT.</p>
<p>The Mail on Sunday said falling prices of machines which allow recording on to blank CDs was good news for Plasmon and rated the stock as a &quot;buy.&quot;</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
